# zcat 1 -- the model catalogue Softanza reads (MP3, SOFTANZA_MODEL_PLACEMENT.md). MODELS.md is the prose beside it; this file is what
# StzModelCatalog(), StzModelSetupPlan() and StzModelsReport() read. A path is relative to the models directory (StzModelsDir()).
#
#   file|<path>|<bytes>|<sha256>|<licence>|<how>|<source url>|<source bytes>|<source sha256>|<steps>
#        how = download (the published file, renamed) | convert (made here from the source by the steps) | derive (made from another
#        catalogued file by the steps)
#   requires|<faculty>|<implementation>|<path>[,<path>...]|<when>       when = "" (always) or lang=<code>[,<code>...]
#   platform|<faculty>|<implementation>|<os>|<what it needs>|<how to get it>
#   replayed|<path>|<date>|<result>      a conversion whose steps were re-run on a machine and gave this exact file (or did not)
#
# Every row was written from MODELS.md, the commit that made the file, and a sha256 of the file on the machine that measured it.

